LilycoveCity_House4_Text_MysteriesAtBottomOfSea: @ 821F5C7
	.string "这颗星球最大的谜团\n"
	.string "在海底。\p"
	.string "有人这么说过，不过我不清楚……$"

LilycoveCity_House4_Text_UnderwaterTrenchMossdeepSootopolis: @ 821F62B
	.string "绿岭市和琉璃市之间\n"
	.string "有一道很深的海沟。\p"
	.string "至少有人这么告诉过我。$"

